# Wildwood Scourge: "another non-Hydra creature". A second Wildwood Scourge (a Hydra) entering with a counter does not grow the
# first one, nor does the first one's own counter from Snakeskin Veil grow it again, and the second does not grow from the first's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Wildwood Scourge
Wildwood Scourge
Snakeskin Veil
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Wildwood Scourge.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Wildwood Scourge.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge#1.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge#2.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Hand.Snakeskin Veil.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge#1.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildwood Scourge#2.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Stack.Count = 0
